Name: octave_pywinauto
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-18
Author: Yu Hongbo <yuhongbo@member.fsf.org>, CNOCTAVE <cnoctave@qq.com>
Maintainer: Yu Hongbo <yuhongbo@member.fsf.org>, CNOCTAVE <cnoctave@qq.com>
Title: Windows GUI automation for GNU Octave
Description: Wraps pywinauto for GNU Octave on Windows.  The pure-Python
 parts of pywinauto and comtypes are vendored as .pyc files compiled for the
 Python versions used by Octave; a ctypes Win32 backend keeps the wrapper
 usable with Octave's built-in CPython, which ships without pywin32.
Depends: octave (>= 8.0.0)
License: GPLv3+
Url: https://github.com/CNOCTAVE/octave_pywinauto
